{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge of the Spooky Express; the only rail service willing to carry the undead passengers of deepest, darkest Trainsylvania. In your new role you'll plan routes and lay train tracks to meet your creepy commuters' demands, and create a rail network spanning more than 170 thoughtfully designed levels.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352310/extras/c7fe7f5ccd377113fbee3a88f320a87d.poster.avif?t=1757160331\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352310/extras/c7fe7f5ccd377113fbee3a88f320a87d.webm?t=1757160331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352310/extras/c7fe7f5ccd377113fbee3a88f320a87d.mp4?t=1757160331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monster has a home of their own: take the vampires to their coffins and the zombies to their graves, and escort the interloping humans away before they\u2019re snacked upon. There\u2019s only room for one at a time in the passenger car and the track can\u2019t cross itself, so plot your route carefully, lay the tracks, and don't let the train miss its stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352310/extras/082753f03e6b64916231e8432d19633c.avif?t=1757160331\" width=1560 height=429 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trainsylvania spans a host of unique locations, with each puzzle forming a cosy diorama, complete with spooky soundtrack. Whether you're puzzling through the Pumpkin Patch, meandering through the Morbid Manor, or investigating the Impish Inferno, you'll find playful touches and surprises around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352310/extras/60c56e89e240815c8b22d0ad0ae9f936.poster.avif?t=1757160331\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352310/extras/60c56e89e240815c8b22d0ad0ae9f936.webm?t=1757160331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352310/extras/60c56e89e240815c8b22d0ad0ae9f936.mp4?t=1757160331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd87 An elegant, playful puzzler, jam-packed with monsters and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude82 Thoughtfully designed puzzles which expertly balance complexity and approachability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf83 Created by the award-winning designers of A Monster's Expedition, A Good Snowman Is Hard To Build, Cosmic Express and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Featuring several delightful comics from David Hellman and Zac Gorman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Accompanied by a haunting soundtrack from Priscilla Snow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No generative artificial intelligence (AI) was used in the creation of this game or promotional materials. Draknek &amp; Friends believes in the value of real human labour and inspiration in all of our endeavours.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3352310?t=1757160331","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3352310?t=1757160331","capsule_im