=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude82 Thoughtfully designed puzzles which expertly balance complexity and approachability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf83 Created by the award-winning designers of A Monster's Expedition, A Good Snowman Is Hard To Build, Cosmic Express and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Featuring several delightful comics from David Hellman and Zac Gorman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Accompanied by a haunting soundtrack from Priscilla Snow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No generative artificial intelligence (AI) was used in the creation of this game or promotional materials. Draknek &amp; Friends believes in the value of real human labour and inspiration in all of our endeavours.</p>","developers":["Draknek and Friends"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352310/5a335989e8937d2dfe6f805419061f12229cb3e2/header.jpg?t=1757160331","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Draknek Limited<br />\r\n<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.15+<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support or Metal 3 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257183165,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183165/movie480.mp4?t=1755187199","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183165/movie_max.mp4?t=1755187199"},"name":"Spooky Express Launch Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183165/a9faf5288901083077d92b774d06534706493002/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755187199","webm":{"48